// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO9/10/11/12/13/14 - dedicated onboard W5500
// Ethernet SPI bus (CS/SCK/MISO/MOSI/IRQ/RST, see vendor "// Ethernet"
// ETH_PHY_* macros - never exposed as pins_arduino.h aliases in the first
// place). Also excludes GPIO42 - dedicated onboard microSD card
// chip-select (SD_SS). The general SPI0 bus (SS=4/MISO=5/MOSI=6/SCK=7)
// stays available.
// pfodWeb NOTE (independent verification, 2026-07-14): confirmed against
// real vendor sources beyond this repo's own pins_arduino.h -
//   - esp3d.io's own hardware board page for this exact board
//     (esp3d.io/ESP3D/Version_3.X/hardware/esp_boards/esp32-s3/
//     lilygo_t-eth-lite/) independently lists: Ethernet W5500 via SPI2
//     SCK=GPIO10/MISO=GPIO11/MOSI=GPIO12/CS=GPIO9/IRQ=GPIO13/RST=GPIO14,
//     and microSD (separate SPI) MISO=GPIO5/MOSI=GPIO6/CLK=GPIO7/
//     CS=GPIO42, explicitly noting "Ethernet SPI cannot be shared with SD
//     card SPI."
//   - LilyGO's own official ESPHome config for this board
//     (github.com/Xinyuan-LilyGO/LilyGO-T-ETH-Series, esphome/
//     lilygo-eth-lite-esp32s3.yaml) independently confirms clk_pin=GPIO10,
//     mosi_pin=GPIO12, miso_pin=GPIO11, cs_pin=GPIO9, interrupt_pin=GPIO13
//     for the W5500.
// Both independent sources match this board's pins_arduino.h exactly -
// exclusion list confirmed, no correction needed.
